    feat(cheeseburger): report the DarwinBoot loader protocol
    
    Locate the UniXNULoader protocol that DarwinBoot installs and print whether
    it is present, so the device test can confirm the driver loaded without
    starting the UEFI Shell.  On the phone it reported Success with 8 block
    devices.

diff --git a/Platforms/Msm8998Pkg/Device/oneplus/cheeseburger/Applications/CheeseburgerInfo/CheeseburgerInfo.c b/Platforms/Msm8998Pkg/Device/oneplus/cheeseburger/Applications/CheeseburgerInfo/CheeseburgerInfo.c
